    "updated_at": "2022-02-22T16:13:52Z",
    "body": "Things to define anew within Fetch (and test) to get rid of \"extract header values\":\r\n\r\n- [x] CORS Content-Type (CORS-safelisted request-header; see whatwg/fetch#829 for a patch)\r\n- [x] <s>request DPR/Downlink/Save-Data/Viewport-Width/Width (CORS-safelisted request-header)</s>\r\n- [x] X-Content-Type-Options (see whatwg/fetch#818 for a patch)\r\n\r\nFor \"extract header list values\":\r\n\r\n- [x] Content-Type (see https://github.com/whatwg/mimesniff/issues/30, whatwg/fetch#831)\r\n- [ ] Access-Control-Expose-Headers (#827)\r\n- [ ] Location (#375, whatwg/fetch#669, whatwg/fetch#843, whatwg/fetch#883)\r\n- [ ] Content-Encoding (see whatwg/fetch#816 for removing a quirk, whatwg/fetch#716 for the remainder)\r\n- [ ] Access-Control-Allow-Methods\r\n- [ ] Access-Control-Allow-Headers\r\n- [ ] Access-Control-Max-Age (https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/21170 might help)\r\n- [x] Access-Control-Allow-Origin and Access-Control-Allow-Credentials (should be a literal match on the return of a \"get\" defined by whatwg/fetch#818; see whatwg/fetch#824 for a patch)\r\n- [ ] Sec-WebSocket-Protocol (#515)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
