    "updated_at": "2021-03-03T16:21:50Z",
    "body": "There's also headers that maybe should be defined in Fetch (or HTTP if it wants to tackle error handling):\r\n- [x] Content-Length: https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1183\r\n- [ ] WWW-Authenticate: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/13189\r\n\r\n(I might end up tracking these separately though as these would be additions rather than refactoring the status quo.)",
